stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> StageTree: local copy Ahead (or Diverged)
    StageTree --> Abort: re-read digest or hash mismatch
    StageTree --> PublishTree: tmp/HOST/ staged and verified
    PublishTree --> PublishRevision: rename to trees/DIGEST/HOST/<br/>(own copy only, never trust another host's)
    PublishRevision --> Confirm: revisions/ID/HOST.json written<br/>(JCS bytes, identical from any writer)
    Confirm --> Unconfirmed: wait timed out (5 min)<br/>or provider freshness Unknown
    Confirm --> MoveHead: provider reports tree and revision uploaded
    Unconfirmed --> MoveHead: move head anyway, status says<br/>pushed, upload unconfirmed
    MoveHead --> SetB: heads/HOST/COPY.json rewritten LAST<br/>(one per member copy, only this host writes it)
    SetB --> Reader: this copy's B set only after the head write
    Abort --> [*]: remove tmp, log ERROR, notify
    Reader --> InFlight: provider not current, or a revision<br/>or the tip tree is missing or fails its digest
    Reader --> Forked: live heads don't converge
    Reader --> Usable: one live tip subsumes every live head = R<br/>(by ancestry, equal-hash tips converge)
    InFlight --> Reader: retry next tick, apply nothing
    Forked --> [*]: ADR 0007, wait for resolve
    Usable --> [*]: continue with ADR 0005
